{"results":[{"url":"https://x.com/SaltAndReality/status/1451380428141596672","final_url":"https://x.com/SaltAndReality/status/1451380428141596672","title":"Your Daily Dose (@SaltAndReality) on X","description":"The myth that Ferdinand Marcos & Jose Rizal established the IMF & World Bank is FALSE. The IMF-WB was established in 1944 by member countries that contribute capital for redevelopment after WW2. It does not take cash or gold deposits. Jose Rizal died 1896 while Marcos born 1917🤣","language":"en","text":"## Post\n\nLog inSign up\n\n## Post\n\nLog inSign up\n\n# Your Daily Dose on X: \"The myth that Ferdinand Marcos & Jose Rizal established the IMF & World Bank is FALSE. The IMF-WB was established in 1944 by member countries that contribute capital for redevelopment after WW2. It does not take cash or gold deposits. Jose Rizal died 1896 while Marcos born 1917🤣\"\n\n## Conversation\n\nYour Daily Dose\n\n@SaltAndReality\n\nThe myth that Ferdinand Marcos & Jose Rizal established the IMF & World Bank is FALSE. The IMF-WB was established in 1944 by member countries that contribute capital for redevelopment after WW2. It does not take cash or gold deposits. Jose Rizal died 1896 while Marcos born 1917🤣\n\n2:50 AM · Oct 22, 2021\n\n32","author":"https://x.com/SaltAndReality","published_date":"2021-10-22T02:50:34.000Z","latency_ms":330.44090600014897,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}